# Built from the simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits 102-116) and
# machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet. The end of the
# Horde leveling chain.
#
# Toxic Horrors and Winterfall Runners (5086, 5087) end the Winterfall
# Firewater chain from 03-winterspring (taken since 0.3.7). Optional here:
# Runecloth (6031), which Meilosh takes only at Neutral with the Timbermaw.
#
# Flow: the Undercity -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (cloth donations) -> fly to
# Splintertree Post -> ride north into Felwood: the Emerald Sanctuary (Greta,
# Eridan) -> Jaedenar's braziers -> the Sanctuary -> Shadow Hold -> the
# Sanctuary -> north past Jaedenar to Bloodvenom Post (Winna, Trull) ->
# Irontree Woods -> Timbermaw Hold (Meilosh) -> through the tunnel to
# Moonglade (Umber, Rabine) -> back through Timbermaw Hold into Winterspring
# (Donova Snowden) -> Everlook (Umi) -> grind to 60 at Frostwhisper Gorge.
#
# Deviations from the export, for a smooth finish:
# - Felwood is one pass from south to north. Greta Mosshoof's chain (5159,
#   5165, 5242) and Linken's Memory (3942) are done at the Emerald Sanctuary
#   on the way in; Jaedenar is only a couple of minutes north of it, so the
#   two short returns to Greta stay in. Dropped: Silver Heart and Aquementas
#   (4084, 4005: the Irontree Heart is in northern Felwood, a second ride
#   south to hand in). Trull's Wild Guardians turn-in (4741) and the Toxic
#   Horrors (5086) come on the way north; the export's second Felwood visit
#   is folded in.
# - Dropped trips that cost a long flight or ride for a few quests: the
#   Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows and Burning Steppes stops (3501, 2623,
#   2801, 2681, 2702, 2701, 4810; the Fallen Hero's chain is worth well under
#   a third of a level behind a flight from the Undercity and a zeppelin
#   back), Stranglethorn (1036, 4621: Bloodsail reputation and elite targets;
#   8240: a Zul'Gurub raid item), the Burning Steppes' Mother's Milk (4866:
#   Blackrock Spire), Alterac Mountains (7241: a battleground quest, dropped
#   with its accept), Ratchet and Duke Hydraxis after 60 (4502, 6804, 6805).
# - The Undercity stop moved first (the route starts next to it) and holds no
#   quests any more: Champion of the Banshee Queen (5961) and the Eastern
#   Plaguelands stop (6030, 5142) went to 06; ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294)
#   needs Un'Goro slime samples the route never collects.
# - The two Orgrimmar stops are one, on the way to Felwood: the runecloth
#   donations (7836, 7824). Calm Before the Storm (4509, 4511) went with Pawn
#   Captures Queen in 06; Betrayed (3507) is turned in by 04.
# - No hearth binds: the guide ends where it grinds. The export's binds (the
#   Undercity, Booty Bay, Orgrimmar, Everlook, Light's Hope) served the
#   dropped trips.
# - With the dropped trips the route ends on a grind (about 59.2 to 60):
#   Rabid Shardtooths at Frostwhisper Gorge, the export's own final camp. A
#   group dungeon is the optional alternative.
#
# Left out (besides the above): the Undercity's cloth donations (7813, 7814,
# 7817), Camp Mojache (7492) and Vivian Lagrave (4769), never turned in;
# Shards of the Felvine (5526: Dire Maul); Wild Guardians' last part and
# Guarding Secrets (4721, 4882: turned in back at Bloodvenom Post).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

