  zone Felwood
  goto 51.2,82.1 "The Emerald Sanctuary"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southern Felwood

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip Fly to Splintertree Post and ride north-west along the road out of Ashenvale into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp just past the border.
  turnin 5159                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5165
  turnin 3942                         -- Eridan Bluewind, inside
  note Eridan's Silver Heart needs an Irontree Heart from northern Felwood and a ride back here. Skip it.

step Dousing the Flames of Protection
  tip Ride north-west to Jaedenar. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one.
  tip Careful: Shadow Council mobs of level 53-55 fill the cave and often come in large linked groups, many with stuns. A group of 2-3 players is recommended.
  interact 176159 quest 5165.2        -- Below ground
  interact 176160 quest 5165.3        -- Below ground
  interact 176158 quest 5165.1        -- Below ground
  interact 176161 quest 5165.4        -- Below ground

step Greta Mosshoof
  tip Back south to the Sanctuary, a short ride.
  turnin 5165
  accept 5242

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Felwood

step Bloodvenom Post
  zone Felwood
  tip Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post.
  turnin 4741                         -- Trull Failbane
  note Trull's next Wild Guardians would bring you back here from Winterspring. Skip it.

step A Final Blow
  tip Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan wait at the back of Shadow Hold, the cave in Jaedenar's north. Clear the tunnel as you go.
  tip Careful: The three bosses fight as a group. Kill the nearby mobs first so you don't pull extra enemies.
  kill 9861 quest 5242.1              -- Below ground
  kill 9860 quest 5242.2              -- Below ground
  collect 13207 quest 5242.3          -- Below ground

step Greta Mosshoof
  tip South to the Sanctuary once more.
  turnin 5242

step Toxic Horrors
  tip Ride north up the Felwood road to Irontree Woods; the Toxic Horrors ooze between the trees, and most of them drop a droplet.
  collect 12822 quest 5086.1

step Moonglade
  zone Moonglade
  goto 44.9,35.6 "Umber"

