# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Winterfall Runners
  tip The runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate.
  tip Careful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with Feign Death, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest.
  collect 12829 quest 5087.1

step Salfa
  turnin 8464
  accept 8469

step Beads for Salfa
  tip Any Winterfall furbolg can carry the beads; the camps just south of Salfa are the closest.
  goto 31.6,36.6 "Frostfire Winterfall camp"
  collect 21383 quest 8469.1

step Salfa
  turnin 8469

